WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:03.440
<b>Kingdom of Barcula, Royal Capital, Bakilatos
Palum Slave Trading Company</b>

00:04.330 --> 00:07.860
A beastman with magical aptitude?

00:07.860 --> 00:09.750
That would make you quite unique.

00:09.750 --> 00:12.900
But what can you do with it?

00:12.900 --> 00:14.820
Well, um...

00:14.820 --> 00:18.500
I'm going to study hard, and I'm sure 
it will prove useful in some way!

00:18.500 --> 00:19.410
Sorry.

00:19.780 --> 00:23.790
I'm looking for someone who will be
immediately useful, not just unique.

00:23.790 --> 00:29.440
I don't intend to take care of you for the 
time it takes you to learn something useful.

00:30.160 --> 00:31.500
Sorry.

00:35.170 --> 00:36.320
Reyva.

00:36.320 --> 00:37.550
I'm sorry.

00:37.550 --> 00:39.270
It didn't work out again.

00:39.270 --> 00:41.140
Don't let it get you down.

00:41.430 --> 00:44.030
I'm sure a good master 
will show up some day.

00:44.030 --> 00:45.070
Yes.

00:48.310 --> 00:49.720
<i>"Some day."</i>

00:49.720 --> 00:53.900
<i>My master, Burton, has been saying 
that for several years now.</i>

00:53.900 --> 00:55.120
Big Sis!

00:59.420 --> 01:02.600
Big Sis! Where are you going, Big Sis?!

01:05.120 --> 01:06.640
It's okay!

01:06.640 --> 01:11.320
I promise I'll send lots 
of money back home, okay?!

01:11.320 --> 01:12.580
It'll be alright!

01:12.840 --> 01:16.140
You take care of Mother, okay?!

01:16.140 --> 01:18.210
Big Sis!

01:18.770 --> 01:21.270
<i>Even though I said that 
and left the village...</i>

03:09.460 --> 03:14.500
<b>Episode 7
The Fox-Eared Girl
of the Royal Capital</b>

03:09.460 --> 03:14.500
<b>Episode 7
The Fox-Eared Girl
of the Royal Capital</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:13.410
Are you going to Dgambo's 
workshop again today?

03:13.410 --> 03:14.390
Yeah.

03:14.390 --> 03:16.680
There's some blacksmithing 
that has to be done

03:16.680 --> 03:18.880
to build the carriage and 
Camellia's horseshoes.

03:18.880 --> 03:22.750
But Mr. Takumi, just the other day,
 you received an extra order

03:22.750 --> 03:25.290
for potions and refrigerators 
from the Papek Company,

03:25.290 --> 03:28.890
and you haven't had any rest 
these past few days, have you?

03:28.890 --> 03:29.910
She's right.

03:29.910 --> 03:32.000
Please consider your health, too.

03:32.000 --> 03:33.580
I'm fine, I'm fine.

03:33.580 --> 03:35.200
I'm not overexerting myself.

03:35.200 --> 03:36.180
Still...

03:36.180 --> 03:38.430
You don't have to worry. I'm fine.

03:38.900 --> 03:40.800
I'm heading out.

03:46.350 --> 03:48.520
I swear, I really saw it!

03:48.520 --> 03:50.720
Our guild hasn't confirmed 
anything like that.

03:50.720 --> 03:53.000
There are others who have seen it, too!

03:53.000 --> 03:56.230
What if something that creepy is 
allowed into our city?

03:53.560 --> 03:55.290
Is something going on?

03:55.290 --> 03:58.960
We've been receiving reports of people seeing 
some creature on the outskirts of the city.

03:56.230 --> 03:58.970
Please at least investigate it!

03:59.220 --> 04:00.720
Oh? A monster?

03:59.280 --> 04:02.550
Call on the knights, 
or whatever you have to do!

04:00.720 --> 04:03.050
We don't know for sure yet.

04:03.410 --> 04:06.840
I made a sketch based on 
reports from the witnesses,

04:07.490 --> 04:09.630
but it looks like some mystery creature.

04:09.630 --> 04:13.200
Well, we haven't received any reports 
of any damage so far either.

04:13.860 --> 04:15.930
So, what brings you here today?

04:15.930 --> 04:18.720
Oh, I wanted to register another pet.

04:18.720 --> 04:20.490
Wow! A second one?

04:20.490 --> 04:21.790
What is it this time?

04:21.790 --> 04:26.230
You went and tamed a Killer Spider, 
so I won't be surprised as easily this time.

04:35.270 --> 04:36.580
That's it!

04:36.580 --> 04:38.540
There it is!

04:38.540 --> 04:39.380
Huh?!

04:42.080 --> 04:43.870
Come with me.

04:43.870 --> 04:45.720
Again?!

04:49.480 --> 04:50.730
I see.

04:50.730 --> 04:52.320
I understand what you want.

04:52.630 --> 04:57.860
We unfortunately don't have a slave 
who fits those conditions at present.

04:57.860 --> 04:59.110
I see.

04:59.110 --> 05:03.530
I'll try reaching out to some fellow traders 
in other towns and the royal capital.

05:03.530 --> 05:04.870
Thank you so much.

05:05.340 --> 05:06.270
Sofia.

05:06.270 --> 05:07.290
You've changed.

05:07.290 --> 05:07.900
Huh?

05:08.200 --> 05:11.840
You've changed since you formed 
a contract with Mr. Iruma.

05:14.130 --> 05:15.780
Sofia!

05:16.190 --> 05:18.160
Are you all done on your end?

05:18.160 --> 05:20.570
I'm going to visit one more butcher.

05:21.420 --> 05:24.790
Lately, Mr. Takumi
has seemed worn out,

05:24.790 --> 05:27.210
so I want to give him plenty of nutrition.

05:27.210 --> 05:29.270
You've noticed that, too?

05:29.270 --> 05:30.330
Yes.

05:30.330 --> 05:36.180
Mr. Takumi tends to get so absorbed in his 
production that he even forgets to eat.

05:36.180 --> 05:38.950
I wish I could lighten his load a little,

05:38.950 --> 05:42.020
but I can't help with his alchemy.

05:42.020 --> 05:44.230
I'll do my best with the cooking.

05:44.230 --> 05:47.380
Then maybe I should at least 
help you prepare our meals.

05:47.380 --> 05:48.910
I-I'm good!

05:48.910 --> 05:51.610
Are you that worried about my help?

05:51.880 --> 05:53.090
I am.

05:53.090 --> 05:54.520
Same.

05:56.050 --> 05:58.420
Sofia, you've changed.

05:58.420 --> 06:00.150
Y-You think so too, Maria?

06:00.150 --> 06:01.420
What does that mean?

06:01.420 --> 06:06.490
Hm, it's like you've started softening
 your expression from time to time.

06:06.490 --> 06:07.760
D-Don't tease me.

06:08.370 --> 06:11.830
Of course, your
gallant side is lovely, too.

06:11.830 --> 06:13.820
Wh-What?

06:14.060 --> 06:18.550
Hey, let's finish our shopping quickly, 
so we can go pick up Mr. Takumi!

06:20.720 --> 06:22.600
M-Mr. Takumi?!

06:22.600 --> 06:24.060
Don't worry.

06:24.060 --> 06:25.570
He's just sleeping.

06:25.570 --> 06:30.170
He's been at it day after day 
with hardly any rest, after all.

06:30.670 --> 06:37.830
Still, I couldn't bring myself to stop him 
 when he looked so happy working.

06:37.830 --> 06:42.880
But if he keeps it up like this, 
one day he really will collapse.

06:50.850 --> 06:53.800
Uh-huh, it's finished!

06:54.190 --> 06:57.120
I'd like to have you draw this, Camellia.

06:59.570 --> 07:01.890
Camellia says she's good to go!

07:01.890 --> 07:02.920
Great!

07:02.920 --> 07:05.040
Then let's give it a test drive—

07:04.050 --> 07:06.240
Mr. Takumi, it's too amazing inside!

07:06.550 --> 07:08.520
I think this is going too far.

07:09.510 --> 07:10.650
What do you think?

07:10.650 --> 07:13.280
I tried enchanting it 
with Spatial Expansion.

