<b>Fully equipped
with measures
to prevent
shaking during
travel, so
hardly any
rocking will be
felt.</b>

07:15.460 --> 07:17.370
You even put a toilet inside.

07:17.370 --> 07:20.840
You won't find a carriage like 
this anywhere on the continent.

07:20.840 --> 07:22.170
It's wonderful!

07:22.170 --> 07:23.950
I can handle cooking easily in there!

07:23.950 --> 07:25.910
It's also big enough to 
make cleaning fulfilling!

07:25.910 --> 07:27.180
Housework will be fulfilling!

07:27.180 --> 07:29.590
There's plenty for me in this carriage!

07:29.590 --> 07:30.850
I'm so excited!

07:30.850 --> 07:32.990
I'm glad to hear you like it.

07:37.910 --> 07:40.420
This is the best!

07:40.420 --> 07:43.840
Camellia, go!

07:46.220 --> 07:49.080
Even though we're riding along at such speed,

07:49.080 --> 07:51.730
I can hardly feel any shaking 
inside the carriage.

07:51.730 --> 07:52.830
Yeah.

07:53.390 --> 07:55.480
Is there anything you're concerned about?

07:55.480 --> 07:59.170
Um, can we attach blades that shoot 
out from the sides of the carriage?

07:59.350 --> 08:00.210
Why?!

08:00.210 --> 08:02.160
Because it would be cool!

08:02.160 --> 08:05.120
Right. I'll think about it.

